#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:1
msgid "治理"
msgstr "Governance"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:3
msgid "使命"
msgstr "Mission"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:5
msgid ""
"作为 Triton 生态的重要组成部分，Triton-Ascend 项目致力于为所有 Ascend NPU 用户提供高效、易用的 Triton "
"编译框架，使 Triton 代码能够高效运行于 Ascend 硬件之上，并积极为丰富 Triton 与 Ascend 生态做出贡献。"
msgstr ""
"As an important component of the Triton ecosystem, the Triton-Ascend"
"project is committed to providing an efficient and user-friendly Triton"
"compilation framework for all Ascend NPU users, enabling Triton code to"
"run efficiently on Ascend hardware and actively contributing to"
"enriching the Triton and Ascend ecosystems."

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:7 ../../zh/community/governance.md:56
msgid "原则"
msgstr "Principles"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:9
msgid "**开放透明**：所有技术决策和社区讨论均在公开渠道进行"
msgstr ""
"**Open and Transparent**: All technical decisions and community"
"discussions are conducted through public channels"
"- **Contribution-Oriented**: Membership is based on individual"
"capability and contribution, not tied to employers"
"- **Community-Driven**: Encourage broad participation, respect diverse"
"viewpoints, and reach consensus through discussion and voting"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:10
msgid "**贡献导向**：成员资格基于个人能力和贡献，不与雇主绑定"
msgstr ""
"**Open and Transparent**: All technical decisions and community"
"discussions are conducted through public channels"
"- **Contribution-Oriented**: Membership is based on individual"
"capability and contribution, not tied to employers"
"- **Community-Driven**: Encourage broad participation, respect diverse"
"viewpoints, and reach consensus through discussion and voting"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:11
msgid "**社区驱动**：鼓励广泛参与，尊重不同观点，通过讨论和投票达成共识"
msgstr ""
"**Open and Transparent**: All technical decisions and community"
"discussions are conducted through public channels"
"- **Contribution-Oriented**: Membership is based on individual"
"capability and contribution, not tied to employers"
"- **Community-Driven**: Encourage broad participation, respect diverse"
"viewpoints, and reach consensus through discussion and voting"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:13
msgid "治理机制"
msgstr "Governance Mechanism"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:15
msgid "Triton-Ascend 是 Triton 社区下的开源项目，角色任命最终决定权归 Triton 社区。项目采用分层技术治理结构："
msgstr ""
"Triton-Ascend is an open-source project under the Triton community, with"
"role appointments ultimately decided by the Triton community. The"
"project adopts a layered technical governance structure:"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:17 ../../zh/community/governance.md:95
msgid "贡献者（Contributor）"
msgstr "Contributor"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:19 ../../zh/community/governance.md:32
msgid "**职责**："
msgstr "**Responsibilities**:"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:20
msgid "协助新贡献者融入项目"
msgstr "Help new contributors integrate into the project"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:21
msgid "处理并回应社区 Issue"
msgstr "Handle and respond to community Issues"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:22
msgid "评审 RFC 和代码"
msgstr "Review RFCs and code"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:24 ../../zh/community/governance.md:41
msgid "**要求**："
msgstr "**Requirements**:"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:25
msgid "至少完成一次贡献"
msgstr "Complete at least one contribution"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:26
msgid "持续积极参与项目，参与形式包括提交 Issue、代码评审、提交代码以及参与社区活动"
msgstr "Continuously and actively participate in the project through submitting Issues, code reviews, code submissions, and participating in community activities"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:28
msgid "**权限**：由 GitHub 仓库 `Triage` 角色授予，包括仓库读取和克隆、Issue 与 PR 提交权限。"
msgstr "**Permissions**: Granted the GitHub repository `Triage` role, including read and clone access, and permission to submit Issues and PRs."

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:30 ../../zh/community/governance.md:77
msgid "维护者（Maintainer）"
msgstr "Maintainer"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:33
msgid "制定项目的愿景和使命，塑造技术方向，确保长期成功"
msgstr "Define the project's vision and mission, shape technical direction, and ensure long-term success"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:34
msgid "拥有代码合并权限，主导路线图规划"
msgstr "Have code merge permissions, lead roadmap planning"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:35
msgid "评审社区贡献，持续改进代码"
msgstr "Review community contributions and continuously improve code"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:36
msgid "负责核心模块的代码质量与架构决策"
msgstr "Responsible for code quality and architectural decisions of core modules"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:37
msgid "参与版本发布决策"
msgstr "Participate in release decisions"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:38
msgid "指导贡献者完成代码贡献"
msgstr "Guide contributors in completing code contributions"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:39
msgid "参与社区技术会议，对技术方向、大型方案和 Release 等事项进行讨论和投票"
msgstr "Participate in community technical meetings, discuss and vote on technical direction, large-scale proposals, and Release matters"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:42
msgid "深刻理解 Triton 和 Triton-Ascend 的代码库"
msgstr "Deep understanding of the Triton and Triton-Ascend codebase"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:43
msgid "承诺持续代码贡献，具备设计、开发和 PR 评审工作流能力"
msgstr "Commitment to continuous code contribution, with capabilities in design, development, and PR review workflows"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:44
msgid "积极参与社区代码评审，交付至少一项主要功能并保持持续高质量贡献"
msgstr "Actively participate in community code reviews, deliver at least one major feature, and maintain continuous high-quality contributions"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:45
msgid "积极处理 Issue、回应咨询、参与讨论"
msgstr "Actively handle Issues, respond to inquiries, and participate in discussions"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:46
msgid "在项目中做出过重大技术贡献（如核心功能开发、架构设计、性能优化等）"
msgstr "Made significant technical contributions to the project (such as core feature development, architectural design, performance optimization, etc.)"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:47
msgid "展现出良好的技术判断力和社区协作能力"
msgstr "Demonstrated good technical judgment and community collaboration skills"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:49
msgid ""
"**权限**：授予 GitHub 仓库写入权限，包括读取、克隆和推送代码至仓库，核心分支保护与合并权限，版本发布执行权限，以及管理 Issue 和"
" Pull Request。"
msgstr ""
"**Permissions**: Granted GitHub repository write permissions, including"
"read, clone, and push code to the repository, core branch protection and"
"merge permissions, release execution permissions, and management of"
"`Issues` and `Pull Requests`."

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:52
msgid "晋升由现有 Maintainer 集体评审，综合考虑贡献质量、持续性和社区参与度。"
msgstr ""
"Promotion is collectively reviewed by existing `Maintainers`,"
"considering contribution quality, continuity, and community engagement."

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:54
msgid "提名与任免"
msgstr "Nomination and Removal"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:58
msgid "成员资格基于个人能力，通过贡献、评审和讨论来体现"
msgstr "Membership is based on individual capability, demonstrated through contributions, reviews, and discussions"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:59
msgid "候选人须认同 Triton-Ascend 的原则并保持行为一致"
msgstr "Candidates must agree with Triton-Ascend's principles and maintain consistent behavior"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:60
msgid "连续 **6 个月** 未参与项目贡献的 Maintainer 可转为荣誉状态（Emeritus）"
msgstr "Maintainers who have not contributed to the project for **6 consecutive months** may be transitioned to Emeritus status"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:61
msgid "成员资格授予个人，不与雇主绑定"
msgstr "Membership is granted to individuals, not tied to employers"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:63
msgid "提名流程"
msgstr "Nomination Process"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:65
msgid "提名可由任何人发起，包括自我提名，以社区issue的方式进行提名"
msgstr "Nominations can be initiated by anyone, including self-nominations, through a community Issue"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:66
msgid "提名时需提供候选人的贡献记录和技术能力说明"
msgstr "Nominations must include the candidate's contribution record and technical capability description"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:67
msgid "现有 Maintainer 审核评估，需**获得当前Maintainer半数及以上同意并无人反对**"
msgstr "Existing Maintainers review and evaluate, requiring **more than half of current Maintainers to agree with no objections**"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:69
msgid "定期审视"
msgstr "Regular Review"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:71
msgid "**每月**在技术例会上对所有 Maintainer 的活跃度进行审视"
msgstr "**Monthly** review of all Maintainers' activity during technical meetings"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:72
msgid "连续**6 个月**未参与项目贡献的 Maintainer，经讨论后可转为荣誉状态（Emeritus）"
msgstr "Maintainers who have not contributed to the project for **6 consecutive months** may be transitioned to Emeritus status after discussion"

#: ../../zh/community/governance.md:73
msgid "Emeritus Maintainer 可随时通过重新活跃贡献申请恢复 Maintainer 身份"
msgstr "Emeritus Maintainers can apply to restore their Maintainer status at any time by resuming active contributions"

